{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30951","headline":"中秋月直禁苑 · 郑畋","name":"中秋月直禁苑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禁署方怀忝，纶闱已再加。\n暂来西掖路，还整上清槎。\n恍惚归丹地，深严宿绦霞。\n幽襟聊自适，闲弄紫薇花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑畋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30951.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30951","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}